          "name": "fn_format_tag",
          "definition": "CREATE FUNCTION `fn_format_tag`(p_prefix VARCHAR(16) CHARSET utf8mb4, p_id BIGINT) RETURNS varchar(64)\n    NO SQL\n    DETERMINISTIC\n    COMMENT 'formats a tag'\nBEGIN\n\tRETURN CONCAT(p_prefix, '-', p_id);\nEND",
